  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ZNCC Women in Enterprise Conference &amp; Awards (WECA) 2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ZNCC Women in Enterprise Conference &amp; Awards (WECA) 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Zimbabwe National Chamber of Commerce (ZNCC) has applied to Sida for funding of 64 000 SEK to carry out the &quot;Women in Enterprise Conference and Awards (WECA)&#x201d; in Zimbabwe during the period 2018. The 2018 WECA conference will bring together women owned business and enterprises  on issues around sustainability, branding and marketing, and tapping into the regional and international markets.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Zimbabwe National Chamber of Commerce (ZNCC) har ans&#xf6;kt om ett bidrag om 64 000 SEK f&#xf6;r att anordna &#x201c;Women in Enterprise Conference and Awards (WECA) &#x201d; i Zimbabwe under perioden 2018. 2018 &#xe5;rs WECA konferens kommer att f&#xf6;ra samman kvinnliga f&#xf6;retagare och entrepren&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r att diskutera fr&#xe5;gor kring h&#xe5;llbarhet, varum&#xe4;rken, marknadsf&#xf6;ring och den regionala och internationella marknaden.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Zimbabwe National Chamber of Commerce (ZNCC) has applied to Sida for funding of 64 000 SEK to carry out the &quot;Women in Enterprise Conference and Awards (WECA)&#x201d; in Zimbabwe during the period 2018. The 2018 WECA conference will bring together women owned business and enterprises on issues around sustainability, branding and marketing, and tapping into the regional and international markets.
This is an annual event held by ZNCC and it will bring women entrepreneurs and experts for discussion and acknowledgement on the key role women play in the developing the Zimbabwean economy through the Women in Enterprise Conference and Awards (WECA).</narrative>
  </description>
